age\u0060: appears in index.md (1), spoke-a.md (1), spoke-b.md (1) = **3 total** (currently recorded as 1 \u274C)\n- \u0060spoke-a\u0060: appears in index.md (1), hub-page.md (1) = **2 total** (currently recorded as 0 \u274C)\n- \u0060spoke-b\u0060: appears in hub-page.md (1) = **1 total** (currently recorded as 5 \u274C)\n\nNow I\u0027ll update each page with the correct inbound-link counts:",
